# The cursor theme of the graphical installer (install-gui, through
# XCURSOR_THEME in cmd/isotope-install-ui/gui.go). Gio asks for the X11 cursor names
# (left_ptr, xterm, hand2...); Adwaita ships only the CSS names (default,
# text, pointer...), and Gio stops with "wl_cursor_theme_get_cursor failed"
# when left_ptr is missing. The links below give Gio's names Adwaita's
# images; the list is gioui.org app/os_unix.go's xCursor table.
[Icon Theme]
Name=Isotope installer
Comment=Adwaita under the X11 cursor names
Inherits=Adwaita
